{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32247","headline":"经故秘书崔监扬州南塘旧居 · 温庭筠","name":"经故秘书崔监扬州南塘旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年曾识范安成，松竹风姿鹤性情。\n西掖曙河横漏响，北山秋月照江声。\n乘舟觅吏经舆县，爲酒求官得步兵。\n千顷水流通故墅，至今留得谢公名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}